  *A:* Exposing a raw `BehaviorSubject` allows any component to call `.next()` and mutate state unpredictably. Instead, keep the subject `private` and expose it publicly as a read-only `asObservable()` or Signal.
- **Q: When would you use `ReplaySubject` instead of `BehaviorSubject`?**
  *A:* When you need to replay multiple historical values (e.g. the last 5 chat messages) or when you do not have a sensible default initial value at instantiation time.

