app.UseRouting();

// 3. CORS (before auth!)
app.UseCors("AllowAngularApp");

// 4. Authentication (who are you?)
app.UseAuthentication();

// 5. Authorization (what can you do?)
app.UseAuthorization();

// 6. Endpoint Execution
app.MapControllers();
```
_Standard ASP.NET Core middleware ordering._

